    <!-- ── Bar replay: the reader's own trades, and the report that comes out of them ─────────
         The replay used to step bars and stop there. These are the strings for the other half:
         a position with a stop and a target, checked against every bar the cursor reveals, and
         a five-tab report of how the reader traded — the same document the strategy tab shows,
         about a different hand. -->
